Package: im.mjh.alipay2nfc
Name: Alipay2NFC
Version: 3.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Redirect Alipay "Tap-to-Pay" (碰一碰) NFC taps to a second/multi-instance Alipay client.
 Hooks the Universal Link / App Clip delivery inside the OFFICIAL Alipay
 (which keeps its App Store signature and entitlements, required for iOS to
 keep delivering the URL), then hands the tap over to the clone via
 UIPasteboard + openApplicationWithBundleID:. The clone is found at runtime
 through enumerateApplicationsOfType:block:, so any bundle id works.
 No Info.plist modification, no re-signing.
 Pure Objective-C runtime hooks (no CydiaSubstrate): works on
 rootful / rootless / roothide and on both arm64 and arm64e.
Maintainer: junhong
Author: junhong
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 14.0)
